  "problem": "Consider the function $f(x,y)=\\frac{2x{y}^{2}-1}{{x}^{2}y}.$ The partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $x$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=\\frac{2h(x,y)}{{x}^{3}y}.\n$$\n\nFind the function $h(x,y).$",
